font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Gotas</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bushmeat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bushmeat\">Carne de caça</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bushmeat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bushmeat\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>1 - 3<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Raw_hide\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Raw hide\">Pele crua pequena</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Raw_hide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Raw hide\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>1 - 1<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fat\">Gordo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fat\" title=\"Fat\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.25 - 0.25<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bone\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bone\">Osso</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bone\" title=\"Bone\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.8 - 0.8<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bone\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bone\">Osso</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bone\" title=\"Bone\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.8 - 0.8<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bone\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bone\">Osso</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bone\" title=\"Bone\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.8 - 0.8<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Animals\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Animals\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Animais</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><big><i><b>O pior pesadelo de toda galinha</b></i></big>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Desova\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Desova</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Comportamentos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comportamentos</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Recebendo_Dano\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Recebendo Dano</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Presas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Presas</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Domesticação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Domesticação</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Colheita\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Colheita</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Spawning\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Desova\">Desova</span></h2>\n<p>As raposas desovam em níveis de luz 7 e superiores, em áreas com chuvas tão baixas quanto 0,25 e em temperaturas entre -15 e 15 para raposas vermelhas e entre -70 e -10 para raposas árticas. Eles não podem aparecer em blocos iluminados por tochas ou lanternas. Eles desovam como animais solitários ou em casal.\n</p><p><span id=\"Behaviors\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comportamentos\">Comportamentos</span></h2>\n<p>As raposas são pequenos criaturas que atacam os jogadores quando provocados. Raposas famintas muitas vezes procuram e matam <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Chicken\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Chicken\">galinhas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Chicken\" title=\"Chicken\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hare\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hare\">lebres</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hare\" title=\"Hare\"> </a></span> próximos.\n</p><p><span id=\"Receiving&#95;Damage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Recebendo_Dano\">Recebendo Dano</span></h3>\n<p>As raposas tornam-se agressivas ao receber danos e atacarão o jogador.\n</p><p><span id=\"Preys\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Presas\">Presas</span></h3>\n<p>As raposas vão caçar:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Chicken\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Chicken\">Galinha</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Chicken\" title=\"Chicken\"> </a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hare\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hare\">Lebre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hare\" title=\"Hare\"> </a></span></li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Domestication\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Domestica.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Domesticação\">Domesticação</span></h2>\n<p>As raposas não podem ser domesticadas, mas podem ser mortas para obter recursos animais. \n</p><p><span id=\"Harvesting\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Colheita\">Colheita</span></h2>\n<p>Abater o animal usando um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Knife\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Knife\">faca</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Knife\" title=\"Knife\"> </a></span> na mão ativa para colher <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bushmeat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bushmeat\">carne de caça</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bushmeat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bushmeat\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Raw_hide\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Raw hide\">pequenas peles</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Raw_hide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Raw hide\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bone\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bone\">ossos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bone\" title=\"Bone\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fat\">gordura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fat\" title=\"Fat\"> </a></span>. \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Entidades</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Passivo</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\">Borboleta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Butterfly\" title=\"Butterfly\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Deer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Deer\">Veado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Deer\" title=\"Deer\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Gazelle\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Gazelle\">Gazela</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Gazelle\" title=\"Gazelle\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Goat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Goat\">Cabra</a><span style=\"display:none